/* 荒野与近郊额外遭遇 / 8 条 × 3 段 / 贝壳箭头·倒木铁锅·渠底界石·湖畔雾笛·红绳草药·通风井布条·残骸厨房·石环外圈石子 */
:: MP Wild Extra Events Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Park")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Park">>
<</if>>
猎人小径尽头的告示板上，最近多了一排用炭笔画的简图。画的人显然不擅长写字，箭头、圆圈和几道波浪线代替了地名。守林人说，这些地方都不远，只是没人愿意在雾散之前去看。
<br><br>
你把八张图按方向排开，发现它们分别指着海岸、林子、农田和湖。纸角用不同的绳结系着，有的结朝海，有的结朝山。最旧的一张已经卷边，图上还沾着盐粒。
<br><br>
<<caveicon>><<link [[第二层洞的贝壳箭头 (0:05)|MP Wild Extra Shell Arrows]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[倒木圈中央的铁锅 (0:05)|MP Wild Extra Log Circle]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[渠底糊泥的界石 (0:05)|MP Wild Extra Boundary Stone]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[清晨只响一声的雾笛 (0:05)|MP Wild Extra Fog Whistle]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[峭壁上换方向的红绳 (0:05)|MP Wild Extra Red Thread Herbs]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[通风井口的多色布条 (0:05)|MP Wild Extra Vent Flags]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[残骸厨房里的热汤 (0:05)|MP Wild Extra Galley Pot]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[石环外圈每天换的石子 (0:05)|MP Wild Extra Pebble Pattern]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[木牌侧面的巡山速写簿 (0:03)|MP Region Extra Events Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开告示板 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Wild Extra Shell Arrows [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "searocks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
大潮退到最低的那天，海蚀洞第一层只剩脚踝深的水。你原本只想捡几枚完整的海胆壳，走到洞腹最里侧时，头顶忽然多出一道缝。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回海礁浅滩 (0:02)|Sea Rocks]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="side-act-mp-wild-extra-shell-arrows">
<<walkicon>><<link "沿箭头走进深处 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-extra-shell-arrows">>
<<set _sk to ($english or 0)>><<if _sk gte 300>>
	<<set $mpClues["wild_extra_shell_path"] to 1>><span class="green">你顺着箭头的转折数了一遍：朝里、朝上、朝地，三段方向对应潮水的涨落和两条岔道。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[转过拐角继续查访 (0:04)|Sea Rocks]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">你盯着那排贝壳看了很久，只觉得像一条乱线。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[收敛呼吸节奏再试 (0:04)|MP Wild Extra Shell Arrows]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂退一步歇脚 (0:03)|Sea Rocks]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "先看被取走的那枚 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-extra-shell-arrows">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $mpClues["wild_extra_shell_path"] to 1>><span class="green">你屏住呼吸顺着器物纹理摸索，没惊动四周便找准了关窍。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[循着眉目往下追查 (0:04)|MP Wild Extra Shell Arrows Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">周围的气息让你有些分神，手背蹭上一层灰渍，只得先缩回手。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[挽起袖口稳稳再试 (0:04)|MP Wild Extra Shell Arrows]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[顺原路退回 (0:03)|Sea Rocks]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Wild Extra Shell Arrows Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "searocks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
洞室往里收窄，最后只剩一条能侧身通过的缝。缝壁上也有贝壳，间隔比外面大，箭头一律朝下。
<<if $mpClues["wild_extra_shell_path"]>><span class="teal">你顺着洞口石壁上白贝壳尖端所指的折角，侧身钻进了收窄的岩石夹缝。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回海礁浅滩 (0:02)|Sea Rocks]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="side-act-mp-wild-extra-shell-arrows-step2">
<<caveicon>><<link "把油布包抽出来 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-extra-shell-arrows-step2">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">><<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set $mpClues["wild_extra_shell_niche"] to 1>><span class="green">你用铜扣的边沿顶住贝壳，顺着凿痕一旋，鸟腹整块弹开。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[把前因后果彻底理清 (0:04)|Sea Rocks]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">贝壳在你手里打滑，铜扣弹进碎石缝。</span><<pain 2>><<stress 5>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[稳住气息重新上手 (0:04)|MP Wild Extra Shell Arrows Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回原处 (0:03)|Sea Rocks]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "耐着性子先听洞外的水声 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-extra-shell-arrows-step2">>
<<if (($willpower or 0) + ($mpClues['wild_extra_shell_path'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 420 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $mpClues["wild_extra_shell_niche"] to 1>>你找准受力支点稳稳使力，手头动作一气呵成。<span class="green">事情办得干净利落，没有留下半点疏漏。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[拿着凭证上前对质 (0:04)|MP Wild Extra Shell Arrows Resolve]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你发力时脚下微滑，手腕偏了半寸没能吃上劲。<span class="red">虎口隐隐发麻，只得先收手缓一口气。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[换个角度再次尝试 (0:04)|MP Wild Extra Shell Arrows Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂且收手离开 (0:03)|Sea Rocks]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Wild Extra Shell Arrows Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "searocks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("wild_extra_shell_arrows_payout")>><</if>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
油布包里是一枚黄铜哨、三枚发黑的旧币和一张折成小块的潮沟图。纸角盖着半个褪色的船锚印，墨已经洇开。你把东西塞进内袋，回头时才发现石坡上的水线变了。
<<if $mpClues["wild_extra_shell_niche"]>><span class="teal">凭着夹缝深处朝下排列的贝壳记号，你从干燥石龛里稳稳取出了油布包。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<set _sk to ($swimmingskill or 0)>>
<<if _sk gte 280>>
	你等到水面回落的那一瞬，蹬住缝壁冲出去，肩膀擦过洞口的岩棱。<<set _reward to 0>><<if _sk gte 500>><<set _reward to 720>><<elseif _sk gte 380>><<set _reward to 480>><<else>><<set _reward to 300>><</if>>
	<<if _first>><<money _reward>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>>
<<else>>
	你冲得太早。浪头把你推回缝里，后脑撞上岩壁，油布包脱手漂走。<<pain 3>><<stress 6>><<tiredness 2>><<set $mpClues["wild_extra_shell_niche"] to 0>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<beachicon>><<link [[沿礁脊回到沙滩 (0:05)|Beach]]>><<pass 5>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[从海岩高处翻回去 (0:04)|Sea Rocks]]>><<pass 4>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Wild Extra Log Circle [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
林子深处有一圈倒木。不是风刮倒的，每一棵都朝圆心倒，树根还带着翻起的黑土，断口是斧头砍出来的斜茬。你绕着走了一圈，数出九棵，粗细差不多，倒下的角度也差不多。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回林缘小径 (0:02)|Forest]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="side-act-mp-wild-extra-log-circle">
<<walkicon>><<link "跨进圈里看铁锅 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-extra-log-circle">>
<<set _sk to ($athletics or 0)>><<if _sk gte 300>>
	<<set $mpClues["wild_extra_log_ring"] to 1>><span class="green">你选了一棵最细的倒木，蹬住树根发力，把它挪开半尺。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[顺着暗径继续前行 (0:04)|Forest]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">倒木比看上去沉。你推了两次，树身只晃了晃，树根下的土却塌了一块，鞋陷进松针里。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[放轻手腕力道再试 (0:04)|MP Wild Extra Log Circle]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[收起工具退回 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "耐着性子先查石头灶的灰 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-extra-log-circle">>
<<if ($history or 0) gte 250 or ($english or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $mpClues["wild_extra_log_ring"] to 1>>你顺着器物纹理巧施寸劲，原本卡滞的关窍应声松开。<span class="green">你将内里藏着的收获稳稳纳入怀中。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[循着眉目往下追查 (0:04)|MP Wild Extra Log Circle Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	冷不防一阵穿堂风吹来，迷了眼角也打乱了手头节奏。<span class="red">指尖在边缘滑脱，你只好先退开半步。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[垫稳脚下重心再试 (0:04)|MP Wild Extra Log Circle]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[转身离开此地 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Wild Extra Log Circle Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
你跨过缺口，脚一落进圈内，林子里的声音就变了。风还在吹，头顶的枝叶却不动，松针也不翻。你走到土包前，锅耳被磨得发亮，内侧有一圈深色的手印。
<<if $mpClues["wild_extra_log_ring"]>><span class="teal">你看清倒木断口上人为锯平的刻痕，避开松软腐叶跨进了风声骤歇的木圈。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回林缘小径 (0:02)|Forest]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="side-act-mp-wild-extra-log-circle-step2">
<<investigateicon>><<link "照着树上的刻痕找 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-extra-log-circle-step2">>
<<set _sk to ($skulduggery or 0)>><<if _sk gte 300>>
	<<set $mpClues["wild_extra_log_cache"] to 1>><span class="green">你用锡勺柄撬开锅底补丁的一角，铜片后面是空的。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[把前因后果彻底理清 (0:04)|Forest]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">补丁的铆钉比看上去硬。你用力一别，锡勺弯了，铜片却纹丝不动。</span><<stress 4>><<pain 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[凑近微光看清再试 (0:04)|MP Wild Extra Log Circle Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂退一步歇脚 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "耐着性子把锅盖原样盖回去 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-extra-log-circle-step2">>
<<if (($science or 0) + ($mpClues['wild_extra_log_ring'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $mpClues["wild_extra_log_cache"] to 1>>你听准林间的斧声，趁空档把散落的木柴码成齐整一垛。<span class="green">柴垛码得齐整，火塘边清爽了许多。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[带着凭证前往核实 (0:04)|MP Wild Extra Log Circle Resolve]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	内里的阻力比看上去沉得多，你试着扳动时震落了一层浮灰。<span class="red">为防弄出太大声响，你先行撤手暂退。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[顺着纹理方向再试 (0:04)|MP Wild Extra Log Circle Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[顺原路退回 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Wild Extra Log Circle Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("wild_extra_log_circle_payout")>><</if>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
你刚把锅盖放回去，缺口外的松针就响了一声。一个人从倒木背后直起身，肩上挂着一卷绳，手里提着一把短斧。斧刃朝下，没有举起来。
<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Eden")>>
	是伊甸。<</if>>
对方走到灶边，用靴尖拨了拨灰，露出底下没烧透的炭。
<<if $mpClues["wild_extra_log_cache"]>><span class="teal">因为你没有乱动铁锅底下的暗记，从倒木后转出的持斧樵夫朝你缓下了神色。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<set _sk to ($willpower or 0)>>
<<if _sk gte 330>>
	你没有提铜片，也没有提树上的刻痕，只说自己在找一条能走回林缘的路。<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Eden")>><<npcincr Eden trust 1>><</if>>
	<<set _reward to 0>><<if _sk gte 480>><<set _reward to 700>><<elseif _sk gte 400>><<set _reward to 500>><<else>><<set _reward to 320>><</if>>
	<<if _first>><<money _reward>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>>
<<else>>
	你把铜片攥得太紧，指节发白。<<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><<set $mpClues["wild_extra_log_cache"] to 0>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[沿东南近路回林缘 (0:06)|Forest]]>><<pass 6>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<parkicon>><<link [[穿过兽径去公园后门 (0:08)|Park]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[顺林间溪流看踏脚青石 (0:04)|MP Moment Forest 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Wild Extra Boundary Stone [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
旱了半个月，农场东边的灌溉渠见了底。渠底的泥裂成一块块翘起的薄片，踩上去会发出脆响。你沿着渠埂走，看见中段被人挖开一道支沟，渠水全拐进了南边的荒地，主渠只剩一层浑汤。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回农场田埂 (0:02)|Farmland]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="side-act-mp-wild-extra-boundary-stone">
<<investigateicon>><<link "把整块石头撬起来 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-extra-boundary-stone">>
<<set _sk to ($english or 0)>><<if _sk gte 300>>
	<<set $mpClues["wild_extra_boundary_old"] to 1>><span class="green">你用麦秸当刷子，一点点刮开泥壳。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[转过拐角继续查访 (0:04)|Farmland]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">泥壳干硬，你刮了几下只掉了一层浮土。指甲缝里塞满泥，字却一个也没认全。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[按住底座晃动再试 (0:04)|MP Wild Extra Boundary Stone]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[退回安全处 (0:03)|Farmland]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "沿支沟走到南边 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-extra-boundary-stone">>
<<if ($maths or 0) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $mpClues["wild_extra_boundary_old"] to 1>><span class="green">你按次序将前后的痕迹逐一印证，很快发现了藏在底下的暗记。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[循着眉目往下追查 (0:04)|MP Wild Extra Boundary Stone Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">杂乱的痕迹看得你眼眶发酸，一时没能把前后的线索对上。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[拂去表面浮尘再试 (0:04)|MP Wild Extra Boundary Stone]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先回入口歇息 (0:03)|Farmland]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Wild Extra Boundary Stone Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
你用锄柄撬动青石，石头在泥里转了半圈，露出背面。背面也刻着字，笔画比正面新，凿痕发白，边缘没有风化。两行字之间隔着一道浅浅的竖线，像有人想把旧界划掉，又没敢凿干净。
<<if $mpClues["wild_extra_boundary_old"]>><span class="teal">你顺着渠边青石正面的旧地界刻字，用锄柄撬开泥层露出了背面的新凿痕。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回农场田埂 (0:02)|Farmland]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="side-act-mp-wild-extra-boundary-stone-step2">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "去柳树下问雇工 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-extra-boundary-stone-step2">>
<<set _sk to ($history or 0)>><<if _sk gte 300>>
	<<set $mpClues["wild_extra_boundary_moved"] to 1>><span class="green">你按新旧两组刻痕的间隔推算，旧界往北偏了整整一垄。被挪走的不是石头，是一条水路。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[把前因后果彻底理清 (0:04)|Farmland]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">你盯着那些刻痕，越看越乱。柳枝的绿汁沾在手上，滑得抓不住石头。</span><<pain 2>><<stress 5>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[听准机括声响再试 (0:04)|MP Wild Extra Boundary Stone Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[收起工具退回 (0:03)|Farmland]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "下到支沟尽头查看 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-extra-boundary-stone-step2">>
<<if (($history or 0) + ($mpClues['wild_extra_boundary_old'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or ($english or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $mpClues["wild_extra_boundary_moved"] to 1>>你借着微光看清细微缝隙，指尖轻拨便理顺了症结。<span class="green">你把暗格深处的旧物一举取了出来。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[拿着凭证上前对质 (0:04)|MP Wild Extra Boundary Stone Resolve]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	周围忽然传来一阵零碎脚步声，惊得你连忙收住动作。<span class="red">时机不对，你决定等风声过去再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[找准借力支点再试 (0:04)|MP Wild Extra Boundary Stone Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[转身离开此地 (0:03)|Farmland]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Wild Extra Boundary Stone Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("wild_extra_boundary_payout")>><</if>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
支沟尽头是一片刚翻过的荒地，土色比农场的地深。地头插着一根细木杆，杆上系着红布，布条的方向和主渠一致。你顺着支沟往回走，柳树下的雇工已经站起来，手里捏着一顶草帽。
<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>>
	麦垛后转出来的是亚历克斯。<</if>>
对方说这条支沟是三天前开的，因为南边那块荒地今年第一次分到水。
<<if $mpClues["wild_extra_boundary_moved"]>><span class="teal">对照青石背面新旧两条界线的偏角，你顺着支沟一眼认出了荒地尽头的红布木杆。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<set _sk to ($willpower or 0)>>
<<if _sk gte 330>>
	你把拓片摊在渠埂上，先念旧界，再念新界，没有指责任何人。<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>><<npcincr Alex love 1>><</if>>
	<<set _reward to 0>><<if _sk gte 480>><<set _reward to 720>><<elseif _sk gte 400>><<set _reward to 500>><<else>><<set _reward to 320>><</if>>
	<<if _first>><<money _reward>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>>
<<else>>
	你把话说得太快，指名道姓问是谁挪的石头。柳树下的雇工把草帽往头上一扣，转身就走。<<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><<set $mpClues["wild_extra_boundary_moved"] to 0>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[从柳树林绕回森林 (0:07)|Forest]]>><<pass 7>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
