<<set _sk to ($willpower or 0)>><<if _sk gte 320>>
	<<set $mpClues["wild_extra_fog_direction"] to 1>><span class="green">你闭上眼睛，只听。声音起来时，左耳的震感比右耳重，尾音被水面拉长。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺着暗径继续前行 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">雾里的声音像从四面八方一起挤过来。你转了几次身，每次都觉得自己背对着它。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[稳住气息重新上手 (0:04)|MP Wild Extra Fog Whistle]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回原处 (0:03)|High Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "沿芦苇道摸过去 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-extra-fog-whistle">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 420 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $mpClues["wild_extra_fog_direction"] to 1>>你先稳住下盘重心，再分寸不差地完成了最后一步。<span class="green">阻碍迎刃而解，手头收获已贴身收好。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[循着眉目往下追查 (0:04)|MP Wild Extra Fog Whistle Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	器物边角沾着湿滑的潮气，你捏紧使劲时还是滑脱了一下。<span class="red">掌心擦出一道红印，眼下未能得手。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[换个角度再次尝试 (0:04)|MP Wild Extra Fog Whistle]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂且收手离开 (0:03)|High Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Wild Extra Fog Whistle Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "lake_ruin">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
浅湾里漂着一只木排，四只旧油桶把它托出水面。木排中央钉着一只铜管，管口朝北，管身缠着防水的蜡布。铜管下面连着一只踏板风箱，风箱的皮囊被湖水泡得发黑，踏板却擦得很亮。
<<if $mpClues["wild_extra_fog_direction"]>><span class="teal">你循着水雾里三短一长的低沉笛声辨清方位，在芦苇浅湾里找到了漂浮的木排。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[先退回街口 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
