	<<set $mpClues["wild_extra_fog_device"] to 1>><span class="green">你拆开风箱侧面的木盖，里面不是普通的皮囊，而是一只可以调音的簧片盒。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[把前因后果彻底理清 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">木盖的钉子锈死在木头里。你用力一撬，盖板裂开，风箱皮囊跟着泄了气，发。</span><<stress 4>><<pain 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[擦干手心汗水再试 (0:04)|MP Wild Extra Fog Whistle Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[退回安全处 (0:03)|High Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "留在木排上等天亮 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-extra-fog-whistle-step2">>
<<if (($maths or 0) + ($mpClues['wild_extra_fog_direction'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $mpClues["wild_extra_fog_device"] to 1>>你换了个顺手的角度切入，原本棘手的阻碍顿时迎刃而解。<span class="green">不费吹灰之力便拿到了里层物件。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[带着凭证前往核实 (0:04)|MP Wild Extra Fog Whistle Resolve]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	光线忽明忽暗晃花了眼，你探手的角度差了毫厘。<span class="red">指节磕在硬物上生疼，只得暂且作罢。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[看准卡槽位置再试 (0:04)|MP Wild Extra Fog Whistle Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先回入口歇息 (0:03)|High Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Wild Extra Fog Whistle Resolve [nobr]
