	<br><br>
	<<link [[避开湿滑边角再试 (0:04)|MP Wild Extra Red Thread Herbs Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂且收手离开 (0:03)|Cliff Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
