	<<walkicon>><<link [[把前因后果彻底理清 (0:04)|Forest]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">搭扣比看上去紧。你一用力，剪子尖滑开，划在铁皮上，发出刺耳的声响。</span><<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[收敛呼吸节奏再试 (0:04)|MP Wild Extra Vent Flags Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂退一步歇脚 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "耐着性子先退回铁梯上等着 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-extra-vent-flags-step2">>
<<if (($science or 0) + ($mpClues['wild_extra_vent_signal'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $mpClues["wild_extra_vent_hider"] to 1>>你趁周围无人留意果断出手，眨眼间便把事情办得滴水不漏。<span class="green">顺手起出了封存完好的贴身收存。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[带着凭证前往核实 (0:04)|MP Wild Extra Vent Flags Resolve]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	暗处的缝隙比预想更窄，手指探进去半分便被卡住。<span class="red">指腹磨得发红，一时半会儿难以寸进。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[挽起袖口稳稳再试 (0:04)|MP Wild Extra Vent Flags Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[顺原路退回 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
