<<if (($maths or 0) + ($mpClues['wild_extra_pebble_message'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $mpClues["wild_extra_pebble_note"] to 1>>你放轻呼吸贴近细看，用巧劲化解了原本僵死的卡扣。<span class="green">妥善取出了藏在夹缝里的那份收获。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[带着凭证前往核实 (0:04)|MP Wild Extra Pebble Pattern Resolve]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	表面那层陈年积垢滑不留手，你使出巧劲却如同打在棉花上。<span class="red">腕部酸涩难当，只能先退回原处歇息。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[拂去表面浮尘再试 (0:04)|MP Wild Extra Pebble Pattern Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
